her with pages of music."}],"title":"attributes","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP"}}}